HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0082.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0083.fits,spectra0084.fits, spectra0085.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0086.fits,spectra0087.fits, spectra0088.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0089.fits,spectra0090.fits, spectra0091.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0092.fits,spectra0093.fits, spectra0094.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0095.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 1.1768191028125452, 0.7617683925134596,0.8452848179311412,              HISTORY 0.9622072104254845, 1.6773379891817943,5.577337982723307,               HISTORY 1.1530016705093127, 1.5144494589307382,0.9471004421662758,              HISTORY 0.8700894340059349, 1.0591642246302293,1.0162132652261795,              HISTORY 0.9842959622327067, 0.8563065911549814.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             